  "measures": [
    {
      "name": "AGWSR Community School District Public Measure IR",
      "jurisdiction": "AGWSR Community School District (Butler, Franklin, Grundy, Hardin counties); Franklin County AGWSR precincts only",
      "ballotLanguage": "Shall the Board of Directors of the AGWSR Community School District in the Counties of Butler, Franklin, Grundy, and Hardin, State of Iowa, be authorized to contract indebtedness and issue General Obligation Bonds in an amount not to exceed $10,820,000 to provide funds to remodel, repair, improve, and equip the high school, including science and family & consumer science classrooms and heating, ventilation, and air conditioning (HVAC), mechanical, plumbing, electrical, roofing, and site improvements; to build, furnish, and equip a multipurpose activities/recess facility, including site improvements; and to remodel, repair, improve, and equip the middle school locker rooms?"
    }
  ],
  "notes": "From official candidate list PDF + combined sample ballots PDF on the county elections site (elections.franklincountyia.gov). Supervisors are elected BY DISTRICT (District 1 and District 2 on the ballot this cycle; voters see only their district). Nancy Knipfel (Recorder) listed as 'No Party'. Empty candidate lists = 'No Candidate(s)' on the official list (write-in only). The candidate list spells 'Mott Township' (sample ballot precincts East Mott / West Mott). The AGWSR school bond (Public Measure IR on the sample ballot; labeled 'IF' on the candidate list) appears only on AGWSR-district ballot styles (Geneva Twp, City of Geneva, Osceola Twp, Grant Twp, Reeve Twp, City of Ackley portions)."
